WEBVTT

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.580
A great disaster cometh.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.040
The fairy who is sworn to be an usher of doom

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.290
shall drag the surging white flames into severe plight.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.040
Take heed.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.670
It is a banquet of tragedy.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.380
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.170
Everyone was the same on the day we uttered our first newborn cry

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.670
Just stumbling onto our backs and looking into the sky

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.920
As the tint of aspiration in your eyes grew deeper and deeper

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.960
I watched you keep drifting further away

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:09.040
Even if what you've been dreaming of

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:13.380
Were to disappear into a pile of ashes

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.250
You will still press on and conquer it

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:22.290
That's what I hope

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:28.880
The small, flickering flame deep within my heart

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:34.670
Burns and twists with a brilliant red color

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:42.750
The young man who fantasized of the sky
spread his wings with yearning

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.040
While bearing countless scars

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.500
Lambton

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.500
Ill Omen

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.750
Ms. Ryu is the murderer?!
I really don't want to believe that!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:06.040
But... if that Jura guy really did help kill her old Familia...

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.210
Was that Ms. Ryu's magic?!

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.880
B-Bell Cranel!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.710
It's you!

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.210
Please! You gotta save me!

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.830
She's gonna kill me for sure!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.670
Ms. Ryu...

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.040
Why are you always getting involved?

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.000
Go somewhere else. You're in the way.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.500
I can't slay that fiend with you standing there.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.960
The only real mistake I ever made...

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.330
was not making absolutely sure
that you were dead, Jura.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.330
My arrogance got the better of me,

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:23.750
I assumed I had killed you and it fills me with
so much regret that I will never live down.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:33.040
I should have completely snuffed out
your life when I had the chance.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.790
Wait, Ms. Ryu...

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.960
I won't hesitate to cut you down if you try and stop me.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.040
Is it true that you're responsible
for this man losing an arm?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.710
That's right. I'm the one who sliced it off.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.040
And I also took off his ear.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.960
What about it? You got a problem?

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:10.540
Then let me ask you this. Are you responsible for
the murder of the man that happened in Rivira?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.040
I don't have time to play questions and answers.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.830
A man was recently found dead on the outskirts of Rivira.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.630
And there are witnesses who
saw you fleeting from the scene.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.170
Get out of my way.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.920
Please, Ms. Ryu! I need to know!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.210
Are the one who killed that man?!

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.670
I did no such thing!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.330
Okay then.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.170
Dude! Why are you standing around?!
Hurry and do something!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.290
Go take that bitch dow-

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.460
Ms. Ryu said that she didn't kill anyone.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.630
And I'm going to believe that.

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.710
Look. This was lying on the ground in
the passageway where we found you.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.170
It's blazerock, right?

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.540
A item drop that's incredibly combustible.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:59.210
The explosion that happened in the passageway
was actually your doing, was it not?

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.210
On top of that, I'm pretty sure those wounds are from a
long time ago, right?

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.790
Back when Gale Wind hunted you down.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.830
The cat's outta the bag, eh!

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.040
You and those asswipes from Rivira
are so goddamn useless!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:35.830
Seriously.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.790
Even if you couldn't take Lion down,
I thought you could at least keep her busy for me!

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:52.130
I'm sorry, Ms. Ryu. I should never have doubted you.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:57.290
No, allow me to apologize. I lost my temper
and it really clouded my judgement.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.580
I appreciate you believing me despite
my foolishness, Mr. Cranel.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.380
Thank you for that.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:11.040
I want to stop that man. So please help me deal with him.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.040
Sure!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.790
Jura! Just give it up!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:19.210
Your plan of provoking that large group
of adventurers into killing me has failed.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.250
No one is here to help you.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.000
Don't tell me you forgot, Lion!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.330
I'm a monster tamer, baby!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.960
It's just as you suspected, Ouranos.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.580
I've discovered a room full of caged monsters.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.170
It seems that the Ikelos Familia weren't
the only ones who used this place.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:54.210
There must have been remnants of Evilus carrying out
some sort of experiment down here.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.080
In any case, this is astonishing...

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.960
I can't believe they managed
to capture monsters from the deep floors.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.960
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:13.250
I get it. There wasn't just one rotten apple...

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.670
it was the entire barrel.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:19.130
We're already short on time and
you just keep getting in the damn way!

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.170
So now we're gonna kill you!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.380
Then we'll put Jura's plan in motion!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.040
Move it!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.210
So those holes were dug by this monster?

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.500
Lambton.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.710
It's a gigantic monster that tunnels through
the ground and can pass from floor to floor.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.080
Lambton?!

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:17.790
Hold on...

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:19.830
There are monsters like that on this floor?!

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.000
No.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.880
It's normally supposed to reside in the deep floors.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.630
A monster from the deep floors?!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.170
What is it doing up here?!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.040
No time to worry about that!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.040
Run for it!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.960
I brought it here from Knossos!

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:41.210
All right! Let's get this party started!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.210
Get 'em! Lambton!

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.710
It's laying waste to everything just by moving!

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.210
We're gonna get wiped out!

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.420
Why?!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.000
I thought that being on this floor meant
everyone could safely avoid the disaster.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.880
Did I make a mistake somewhere?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.380
This way!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.460
We can't put up any sort of fight in here!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.880
Hey Pipsqueak! Find a field for us!

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.170
A "field"? What does that mean?

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.040
One of those rooms on this floor
that comes to a dead-end!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.420
If there's no flowing water around,
then it should have a field!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.170
You gotta lead us to one of those!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.580
I don't hear the monster anymore!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.790
Did we lose it?

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.460
No. It's nearby!

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.080
It's digging through the ground! But which side?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.540
No! It's beneath us!

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.960
This is totally insane!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.580
There's even more monsters like this
on the deeper floors?!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.830
It's impossible to follow that Turk guy now.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.290
But I hate not being able to pull through for Bell Cranel
after he specifically asked me to!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.460
Now's our chance!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.750
Hurry and finish up the preparations!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.580
Jump, Lambton!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.290
Not good!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.880
Bet you're wondering where it went, huh?!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.380
Where is it...?

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:43.880
Where will it come from?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.880
Do you think it's going to come for you?

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.380
Too bad you're wrong!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.580
Ms. Ryu!

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.420
Ugh, it's way too erratic!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.130
Hey Lion!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:13.170
Hope you're ready to become monster food after it
chomps down on you and your friend Bell Cranel!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.540
JURA!

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:29.880
Such a good boy, isn't he?

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:35.830
Ms. Ryu... is this guy just
a really high level tamer or what?

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:39.420
He's manipulating a monster from
the deep floors like it's nothing!

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:42.580
No. Jura was never that strong.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:47.130
Having a hard time understanding
why my pet listens to my every whim?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.040
This is why!

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.080
It's a magic item that can enslave monsters.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:58.580
Those guys who were in Knossos managed
to create this forbidden item.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:03.630
And with its power... any monster
becomes an adorable pet!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:09.130
Aw, dammit. This friggin' elf annoys me so much.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:12.130
Just look at how badly my hand is trembling!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.500
It's fear from all the trauma you've inflicted on me!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.130
There was a sea of blood after you went on a rampage

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:23.210
and I can't get the sight of you slaughtering
our Familia out of my head!

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.580
I still see it every damn time I close my eyes!

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:29.710
Which is why...

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:33.790
I'm just going to have this monster
kill you instead of doing it myself!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.670
This is it! We found a field!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.460
Haruhime! Time for Level Boost!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:53.830
Start chanting the spell.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.130
Are you talking about Kokonoe?!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.250
You want me to cast it on everyone that I can?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.710
No, just two!

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.790
Having you collapse from exhaustion
here would hurt us in the long run.

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:04.960
Boost the two in the vanguard.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.210
The rearguard should ready their bows!

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:08.290
R-right!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:09.420
What about magic swords?

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.420
Don't bother. You'd just be wasting them.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.460
That monster has a very keen sense for magic.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.830
We have to start by taking out its eyes!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.880
First that enhanced species and now this.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.880
Being together with you guys never
fails to keep me entertained!

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:29.040
That's a line I never thought I'd hear from
a Barbera even in my wildest dreams.

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:33.670
Yeah, I'm surprised. Or should I say honored?

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.290
Uchide no Kozuchi!

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.170
Here it comes!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.380
Dance and whirl!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.130
This thing is obnoxious.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:10.540
That's true, but I've already figured out the pattern of
how the monster moves in response to his orders.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.580
Huh?

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.170
We could destroy that necklace pretty easily,

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.420
but freeing it from his power might make
things worse if it goes on a rampage afterwards.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.210
I'll take it down.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.460
You cover me, Mr. Cranel.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.790
Uh, sure!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:28.670
When it makes a move to burrow underground,
I want you to stop it with your magic.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.830
Okay. I'll do my best!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.540
This isn't my first fight with a Lambton.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.630
I should be able to win.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.080
Hey Bell Cranel!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:47.500
Take it from me, being around that bitch
is nothing but a death sentence!

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.710
Don't pay him any attention.

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.710
C'mon, hear me out.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:58.170
Just how many people do you think died
as a result of Lion finding me?

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:04.000
I knew she wouldn't stop until she'd caught me,
which is why I used Turk to deal with her.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:09.380
I told him to turn those idiots in Rivira against her,
so she'd have a hard time keeping up.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:15.630
You can bet Jean was killed to spur them into forming an
execution squad that would hunt her down.

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:18.960
Turk's a pretty craft guy like that!

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.000
But that Jean guy was on your side, wasn't he?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.420
Yeah, he was one of my buds.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:29.330
But guess what? Plenty of my other buds
burned to death for me in the explosions, too!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.460
All the dead people in that passageway were with you?!

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.790
I bet seeing that really motivated
the execution squad, huh?

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.330
They all freaked out thinking
Gale Wind was so ruthless!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.920
You're an absolute scumbag.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.420
Jura! Quit trying to drag this out with your bullcrap!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.250
Mr. Cranel. Don't listen to a word he has to say.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.080
Just stay focused on the task at hand.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.000
We're going to wipe out that monster
and then capture him!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.210
Okay!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.880
Now in the skies of the distant forest...

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.710
to the infinite stars mounted upon
the eternal firmament of the night.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:19.710
Shit!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.630
This fool does entreat, just once for
the divine protection of the stars' fire.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.830
Grant thy benevolent light to
the one who abandoned thee!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:33.040
Come forth, wandering wind, the vagabond traveler.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:37.290
Run with great swiftness like no other,
across sky and wilderness!

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:38.580
Aw hell!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.130
Go under, Lambton!

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:44.920
Not happening!

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.330
FIRE BOLT!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.960
Let the light of stardust occupy me and strike my enemy!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.790
LUMINOUS WIND!

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.380
Amazing...

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.630
Hang tough, vanguard! Just one more to go!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:29.960
Soul Light!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.170
It stopped!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.790
Now's your chance, Lady Chigusa!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.460
This one will end it for sure!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.830
HELL KAIOS!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.000
We did it!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.710
We actually beat a deep floor monster!

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:07.960
What a fight!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.500
Every inch of me is sore right now...

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.540
We got an item drop from it!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.170
Your greed really knows no bounds, Liliruca.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.960
Lady Cassandra!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:21.750
Would you mind casting another
healing spell on everyone?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.080
Lady Cassandra?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:28.250
This was the great disaster?

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:29.790
It couldn't be.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:36.460
There's not enough fear. Not enough despair.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.670
It was too easily defeated to be an "embodiment of ruin".

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:41.790
This is wrong.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:44.210
This isn't the disaster.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.790
The end? No way!

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:53.330
This is just the beginning!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.630
What are you talking about?!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.210
I was just a distraction.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.500
That's all of 'em.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.290
Alright, let's do this! Light 'em up!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:12.210
Now!

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:24.710
What the?!

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.040
The floor's collapsing!

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:31.000
Run! RUN!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.380
Hey Bors!

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.500
What is this? What the hell is happening?!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:42.960
My boys got to work while you were busy chasing me.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:46.960
And just now, they ignited every
last blazerock that we had.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.420
What?!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:55.130
This area where the Great Falls penetrates through can
be perceived as a singular floor.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.330
Everything gets shared including the damage it takes!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.540
That's what the dungeon will think...

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.330
making it delirious!

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.420
The dungeon is what?

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.290
You couldn't have...

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.830
Oh but I did.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.710
I've summoned despair!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.170
JURA!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:18.580
DO YOU REALLY UNDERSTAND THE GRAVITY OF
WHAT YOU JUST DID?!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:22.380
In the 5 years since you nearly killed me,
I've done so much research on it!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:26.500
Like where the best place to trigger it was,
and how I could make it happen!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:33.540
Also how I could turn that pretty face of yours
in to a pathetic, disgusting mess!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.710
That's what was on my mind the whole time!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.630
YOU BASTARD!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.540
Don't do it, Ms. Ryu!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:45.000
LET ME GO! I SAID LET ME GO!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.830
What's that sound?

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.130
Ms. Ryu...?

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.920
Not again.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.000
It's exactly the same. That thing... it's coming...

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.040
Oh... Alise...

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:16.670
H-hey, so...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.380
Run away.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.210
Huh?

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:20.290
You have to run!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.290
Hurry and get away!

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:24.500
At the very least you have to escape! Get out of here!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.420
Hurry up!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.580
Too late!

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:31.750
We're in the presence of despair!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:33.880
Yes! Come on!

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.750
Show yourself to everyone!

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.080
One more time! Let us see it up close!

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:49.080
A great disaster... cometh.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.750
Take heed.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.460
It is a banquet of tragedy.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:22.330
In a deep place that no one knows of

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:26.750
The scenario to today remains closed

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:29.500
You are not alone

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:37.880
A mix of emotions (ah) supported us

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:42.670
Definitely standing up, definitely pushing on

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.420
Although "definitely" is not a word I can say

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:57.250
Feeling an urge, I watched from the side
as you went without hesitation

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:00.330
To a world that is not free

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:05.330
Stopping to hear every poem whether pleasant or painful

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:10.540
Wanting to see and decide first-hand
no matter how firmly your belief

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:14.080
Waking up to head towards the voices

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:20.830
Worrying and leaving your own marks to guide the way

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:29.080
Let's lay our hands together on the future we strongly wished for

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:42.080
Next Time

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:42.080
Juggernaut

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:42.080
The Destroyer

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.630
Next time: "Juggernaut."
